  "why": "A river valley in section: terrain with a riverbed and a waterBody river, a shaft dug on the left bank (the world cut) and a bore that runs from its foot to under the river. Mud caves in and river water floods it, a yellow shield pushes through, concrete rings line it, its wheel cuts and a belt carries the mud up the shaft, smoke is cleared by roof fans, and a road and ceiling lights finish it. The camera opens on the shaft being dug, then holds the tunnel's section under the river.",
